@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = TOKEN

### Consultar meus dados
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Atualizar meus dados
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Guilherme Rocha Atualizado",
    "email": "guilherme@teste.com"
}


### Alterar minha senha
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/me/senha
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "senhaAtual": "Teste@12",
    "senhaNova": "NovaSenha@123",
    "confirmarSenha": "NovaSenha@123"
}


### Listar administradores
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buscar administrador por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buscar administrador por e-mail
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/buscar/email?email=guilherme5@teste.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buscar administradores por nome
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/buscar/nome?nome=tes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Criar administrador
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste 2",
    "email": "teste2@teste.com",
    "senha": "Teste@12"
}


### Atualizar administrador (nome e e-mail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste 02",
    "email": "teste02@outroteste.com"
}


### Deletar administrador
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
